UPDATE companies SET description='Electronic Specialty Company was founded in 1947 as a locally owned West Virginia corporation in Dunbar, just outside Charleston. Over the decades it has grown into one of the largest electronic systems integrators in the Mid‑Atlantic region, operating from its headquarters on Dunbar Avenue.

