UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Electronic Systems was founded in 1986 and operates from three UK sites: Enniskillen in Northern Ireland, Livingston in Scotland, and Chesterfield in England. The business began as an electronics manufacturing services provider and has grown to employ over 300 people across its facilities.

