UPDATE companies SET description='Solar Works Energy operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico, serving residential customers across New Mexico, Colorado, and Texas. The company focuses on designing and installing rooftop and ground-mounted solar photovoltaic systems for homeowners seeking to reduce electricity costs.

