UPDATE companies SET description='EverGuard Solar was founded in 2008 in Albuquerque, New Mexico, as a family-owned solar installation and design company. The business began with a focus on serving New Mexico communities using local labor and regional expertise, and it has remained locally operated without outsourcing to out-of-state contractors.

The company designs and installs photovoltaic systems for residential, commercial, government, and industrial customers across the Albuquerque–Santa Fe metro area and beyond, including Rio Rancho, Los Lunas, Santa Fe, and Los Alamos. Its services cover grid-tied solar arrays, off-grid installations with battery storage, and assistance with financing options such as loans, leases, and power purchase agreements. EverGuard also helps clients navigate federal tax credits and state incentives to reduce upfront costs.

Customers range from homeowners seeking to lower electricity bills to commercial property owners, municipal facilities, and industrial sites looking for energy independence.

