UPDATE companies SET description='Extron is headquartered in Raleigh, North Carolina, where it designs and manufactures professional audiovisual equipment for installed applications. The company operates globally with localized websites and support across the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia‑Pacific.

Its product portfolio centers on signal processing and distribution for ProAV systems: seamless scaling matrix switchers, HDMI and USB‑C extenders, control processors, audio de‑embedders, and AV‑over‑IP solutions. The catalog includes compact wallplate transmitters, multi‑format switchers with 8K support, and networked AV platforms such as the NAV series. Extron also publishes design guides and runs a training program for system integrators and technicians.

Recent case studies reference esports labs at Indiana State University, surgical education at The Faculty Clinic in Stockholm, and dental instruction at International Medical University in Malaysia.

Extron emphasizes interoperability and standards‑based design, offering resources like the Professional AV over IP Design Guide and 802.1X primers to help specifiers deploy reliable, secure networks. A three‑year parts‑and‑labor warranty covers most hardware, and the firm maintains a dedicated support hotline for technical assistance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Seamless scaling matrix switching", "HDMI/USB\u2011C signal extension over twisted pair", "AV\u2011over\u2011IP distribution (NAV series)", "Control system programming and touchpanel interfaces", "Audio de\u2011embedding and DSP", "Professional AV system design consulting", "Technical training and certification courses"], "industries": ["Higher education", "Healthcare and medical education", "Corporate enterprise", "Esports and gaming venues", "Government and defense", "Live events and production"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Three\u2011year parts and labor warranty on most hardware", "Free design guides and technical primers for AV\u2011over\u2011IP deployments", "Dedicated 800\u2011number support hotline"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Raleigh, NC -> db", "Manufactures ProAV hardware (matrix switchers, extenders, control systems) -> /", "Global website localization in 15+ languages -> /", "RoHS certification listed -> db", "Case studies: Indiana State University (esports), The Faculty Clinic Stockholm (surgical education), International Medical University Malaysia (dental instruction) -> /", "Three\u2011year parts and labor warranty mentioned in product specs -> /", "Support hotline  displayed on homepage -> /", "Training courses and design guides offered -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Now Shipping! DTP3 CrossPoint 42 USB Compact 4x2 Seamless Scaling Matrix Switcher with USB", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": ""