UPDATE companies SET description='FP Performance Premium Exhaust Systems operates from Freehold, New Jersey. The company was founded by a group of passionate automotive enthusiasts who set out to redefine the performance exhaust segment by pushing the boundaries of performance, sound, and quality. No founding year is publicly disclosed, and the ownership structure has not been specified.

