UPDATE companies SET description='Food Warming Equipment Company, Inc. (FWE) operates from Portland, Tennessee, where it designs and builds commercial foodservice equipment in the United States. The company invites visitors to explore its products, processes, and a virtual factory tour through its website.

FWE manufactures a range of heated and non-heated cabinets for commercial kitchens, including proofers, heated holding cabinets, rethermalization ovens, heated and non-heated transport cabinets, utility racks, moisture and proofing cabinets, tray line equipment, and pizza holding cabinets. New product lines such as the ETC-2333-PH and PHTT-2333 series address proofing and holding for items like donut screens up to 23″ × 33″.

The primary market is K–12 school foodservice, where FWE promotes Energy Star–certified models and partners with the School Nutrition Foundation to donate equipment to qualifying districts. The company also serves broader commercial foodservice, pizza operations, and stadium and venue dining, exhibiting alongside partners Hatco and Ovention at events such as the Pizza Expo, ALSD Experience, and SNA Annual National Conference. A network of local sales representatives supports the buying process.

FWE states that its differentiation rests on four pillars: value-driven design and streamlined manufacturing, customer-focused service with a dedicated point of contact, expert design capability for custom equipment, and an award-winning team recognized by customers, reps, dealers, and consultants. Keith Cochran was named General Manager in September 2026.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial foodservice equipment manufacturing", "Proofer manufacturing", "Heated holding cabinet manufacturing", "Rethermalization oven manufacturing", "Heated transport cabinet manufacturing", "Non-heated transport cabinet manufacturing", "Utility rack manufacturing", "Moisture and proofing cabinet manufacturing", "Tray line equipment manufacturing", "Pizza holding cabinet manufacturing", "Direct-from-factory parts distribution", "OEM part replacement", "Quick ship program (24\u201348 hours)", "Custom equipment design", "Energy Star certified product lines"], "industries": ["School foodservice (K\u201312)", "Commercial foodservice", "Pizza restaurant operations", "Stadium and venue foodservice", "School nutrition programs"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["ETC-2333-PH Series (Non-Insulated Proofer & Heated Holding Cabinets)", "PHTT-2333 Series (Insulated Proofer & Heated Holding Cabinets)", "Rethermalization (Retherm) Ovens"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping on OEM replacement parts; 24\u201348 hours for Quick Ship models", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Commercial foodservice equipment built in the USA", "Same-day shipping and free delivery on OEM replacement parts", "Virtual factory tour available online", "Partnerships with Hatco and Ovention for joint events"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Portland, Tennessee -> db", "Company name: Food Warming Equipment Company, Inc. -> /", "Manufactures commercial foodservice equipment in USA -> /", "Virtual factory tour mentioned -> /", "Product categories: proofers, heated holding, rethermaliza