UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Clifton, New Jersey, Fabric Textile Products, Inc. operates as a print-on-demand manufacturer and fulfillment provider for custom home decor products. The company emphasizes domestic production, with all printing and fulfillment conducted at its New Jersey facility.

