UPDATE companies SET description='Fabricated Metals operates from Louisville, Kentucky, where it was founded in 1955. The company remains a privately held, family-owned business, having grown from its origins as a metal fabrication shop into a preferred partner for original equipment manufacturers in the rail, transit, communication, and energy storage sectors.

